    <string name="textures_rules">• Name: the 16 hex characters of the texture hash, the rest is ignored, for example 1F1ED618559910C0.png or 1F1ED618559910C0_hair.dds\n• All images in the replace/ folder of the pack, no subfolders\n• PNG (any type) or DDS BC1/BC2/BC3/BC7 or 32-bit uncompressed\n• Any size: mipmaps are built when the texture loads\n• Same packs as the PC version (texture_folder/replace)</string>
    <string name="gpu_notice_text">Snapdragon 865 or newer (e.g. Retroid Pocket 5) should run the game with the system driver; Turnip is optional, in the Drivers tab.\n\nMali GPUs (e.g. Mali-G57 in the RG Cube) run it slower: keep 30 FPS and 1x resolution in the Performance tab.\n\nThis is an early version: export the logs (About tab) to report problems.</string>
